po, ignored `testdata`/`node_modules`, Helm, 404, curl error, bad package.json, bad LTS_TODAY, missing yq exit 2).\n\n## Open issues\n- Not run here (no network, no Docker): the integration tests, `make image-test` and `make lts-fixtures`. A human should run `go test -tags integration ./internal/roles/ -run Lts` and `make image-test`.\n- Deviations from the plan: the eol and refs golden cases are inline Go tables, not fixture directories, so there is no `TestLtsFixtureCasesListed` and no `api/synthetic.json` (the synthetic product is a literal in `lts_test.go`). No `lts_docker_integration_test.go` was written. `CLAUDE.md` has no Layout lines naming `internal/roles/` scanners, so it is unchanged.\n- The root `Dockerfile`, `deploy/` and docs paths may be merge-protected, so a human must approve.\n- Helm references have no line number (`line` is 0, shown as the path alone).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":714,"cache_read_input_tokens":102466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":714},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df64a9c0-ea4b-43ef-9ca6-e1675383808b","uuid":"e27884e3-b73b-4b79-b470-5cfb6a6e5cab","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:13:34.988Z","request_id":"req_011ChMjVVECV7xfURM63PpDn"}
